Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?bsp/abstract-machine:=20=E6=94=B9=E7=94=A8=20AR?=
 =?UTF-8?q?CH=20=E9=97=A8=E6=8E=A7=20extra.ld=20=E9=80=82=E9=85=8D=20SoC?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E9=93=BE=E6=8E=A5?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
